Bates, Bates, what do you think he's at?

00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:35.840
He'll drink what we...

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:40.420
Ridgetown, Barbados.

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:44.270
Five years I've been here.

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:57.730
Forster, send me the note.

00:09:59.020 --> 00:09:59.320
The doubt.

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:03.370
Drink?

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:05.170
A little ginger ale.

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:05.790
Here it is.

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:10.280
That'll be exactly one dollar.

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:14.300
Look, mister, never mind.

00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:18.160
Mutual prosperity, Mr. Forster.

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:21.010
Before I drink to that, you might tell me who you are.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:28.000
If you like, Nicholas Beal, agent.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:30.960
Agent Fork, Mr. Buell.

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:33.960
At Ben's, possibly for you.

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:38.740
Forster promises clean city with Hanson conviction.

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:39.580
That's right.

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:42.520
Only I hear you run into a little snag.

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:43.770
Some missing books.

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:45.290
Where did you hear about that?

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:48.370
What would you say if I dig them up for you?

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.560
And why would you be so obliging?

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:54.160
I'm just a humble follower of your work.

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:59.630
Wayward boys set right, criminals successfully prosecuted, and I...

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:04.670
Admire you, incorruptible enemy of the legions of evil.

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:07.750
It's rather a flamboyant way of putting it.

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:13.170
Perhaps. Of course, I'm not altogether altruistic.

00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:14.670
I thought so.

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:16.320
But you're interested.

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:18.980
