00:14:48.290 --> 00:14:49.350
You're not sorry for it?

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:51.150
No, it's something else.

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:53.600
Never mind telling you about Hanson's account books.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:53.960
Of course.

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:56.920
