00:14:58.560 --> 00:14:59.220
I stole them.

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:03.070
I didn't have a warrant to search the cannery until afterwards.

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:06.260
Do you mind drinking with the criminal?

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:08.380
I don't know.

00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:11.030
