00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:13.600
But you've never done anything like that before.

00:15:14.360 --> 00:15:16.040
I never convicted Hanson before, either.

00:15:16.690 --> 00:15:17.610
Yes, I know.

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:22.880
But, Joseph, next time, even if it's more important than Hanson,

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:24.460
