00:55:50.460 --> 00:55:52.020
That's really pulling in, Mr. Faulkner.

00:55:54.580 --> 00:55:57.340
Joseph, you didn't make any arrangement for Faulkner, did you?

00:55:57.780 --> 00:55:58.720
No, Pam, I didn't.

00:55:58.940 --> 00:55:59.960
Then he must be double-crossing.

00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:00.780
Kennedy in some way.

00:56:00.900 --> 00:56:05.280
Kennedy, 7, 8, 8, 2, 8, 2.

00:56:06.020 --> 00:56:11.140
Foster, 8, 4, 7, 2, 6, 6.

00:56:11.440 --> 00:56:11.780
Hooray!

00:56:12.400 --> 00:56:15.640
There's over 60,000 ahead.

00:56:15.740 --> 00:56:16.240
That's wonderful.

00:56:16.720 --> 00:56:17.180
Hello, Bill.

00:56:19.440 --> 00:56:22.280
Faulkner, the governor.

00:56:23.720 --> 00:56:24.560
It's like we're in business.

00:56:24.910 --> 00:56:25.230
What's that?

00:56:25.740 --> 00:56:26.880
Let's go over here, Faulkner.

00:56:27.310 --> 00:56:28.550
Nothing from the 21st yet, eh?

00:56:33.340 --> 00:56:35.920
I'd like you to explain your remark about being in business.

00:56:36.020 --> 00:56:36.660
That's what I said.

00:56:36.940 --> 00:56:38.390
I wouldn't worry about the 21st.

00:56:38.490 --> 00:56:39.510
You could have had full there, too.

00:56:40.160 --> 00:56:41.660
That 50 grand you gave me to spread around,

00:56:41.740 --> 00:56:43.220
it'll pay off about three votes to the dollar.

00:56:43.360 --> 00:56:44.580
You gave him $50,000?

00:56:45.840 --> 00:56:46.500
Why did you get it?

00:56:46.810 --> 00:56:48.470
From me, Joseph.

00:56:48.880 --> 00:56:50.920
It was only a no, and I'll pay it back when I can.

00:56:51.490 --> 00:56:52.810
Quiet! Quiet, everybody!

00:56:53.290 --> 00:56:54.690
We have some important news!

00:56:54.850 --> 00:56:55.690
We just got a flash.

00:56:55.850 --> 00:56:57.010
Kennedy can face the election!

00:57:01.980 --> 00:57:09.490
I don't want to say, you've worked harder than any group I've ever known.

00:57:10.310 --> 00:57:12.700
You've been swell, and I won't forget it.

00:57:12.840 --> 00:57:14.540
Can I... Pardon me.

00:57:14.980 --> 00:57:15.740
Congratulations, Governor.

00:57:16.020 --> 00:57:17.800
A wonderful night, Governor. A wonderful night.

00:57:18.080 --> 00:57:20.210
Let me explain.

00:57:20.410 --> 00:57:20.850
Good night, Joseph.

00:57:28.350 --> 00:57:29.940
Don't worry. They'll come around.

00:57:30.000 --> 00:57:32.900
Of course they will. They don't understand.

00:57:33.280 --> 00:57:34.860
You're elected, darling. You're governor.

00:57:35.320 --> 00:57:37.080
Now you can do all the wonderful things you want to

00:57:37.080 --> 00:57:38.260
and prove how wrong they were.

00:57:38.440 --> 00:57:40.460
How about a celebration? This doesn't happen every day.

00:57:40.640 --> 00:57:42.360
Of course we'll celebrate.

00:57:42.620 --> 00:57:44.880
That's the ticket. Listen, everybody.

00:57:45.340 --> 00:57:47.100
We're having a party at the gold room.

00:57:47.450 --> 00:57:49.370
Music, floor show, all the trimmings.

00:57:50.670 --> 00:57:53.750
That's on me. Coming, Foster?

00:57:54.610 --> 00:57:55.770
I've never danced with the governor.

00:57:56.160 --> 00:57:58.220
Yes, I'm coming. With bells on.

00:57:58.220 --> 00:57:59.040
That's the spirit.

00:58:04.830 --> 00:58:06.800
Hello. Yes, just a moment.

00:58:07.270 --> 00:58:07.710
Who is it?

00:58:08.640 --> 00:58:09.740
Mrs. Foster's on the floor.

00:58:10.060 --> 00:58:11.800
Tell her the governor is in conference.

00:58:20.540 --> 00:58:29.240
And, uh, oh, no, no.

00:58:31.120 --> 00:58:33.380
33. What? You heard me, 33.

00:58:33.700 --> 00:58:34.680
Let's get on with it.

00:58:34.800 --> 00:58:35.280
Yes, Governor.

00:58:35.980 --> 00:58:36.960
Mr. Beale is here.

00:58:37.540 --> 00:58:42.010
Set him in. Get this right, it has to last two years.

00:58:42.720 --> 00:58:43.440
Maybe four.

00:58:43.940 --> 00:58:44.360
Hello, Nick.

00:58:45.590 --> 00:58:46.750
See the early edition of the Globe?

00:58:46.950 --> 00:58:47.570
No, I haven't.

00:58:47.720 --> 00:58:48.940
Something in there might interest you.

00:58:49.230 --> 00:58:49.550
Read it.

00:58:50.650 --> 00:58:52.690
Independent Party disowns Forster.

00:58:53.830 --> 00:58:55.790
In a move unparalleled in political history,

00:58:55.930 --> 00:58:59.790
the Independent Party today renounced its connection with Governor-elect Joseph Forster.

00:59:00.990 --> 00:59:06.230
Superior Judge Ben Hobson disclosed that Foster's misuse of unauthorized campaign contributions...

00:59:06.230 --> 00:59:07.210
Let me see that!

00:59:11.290 --> 00:59:12.510
A critical old goat.

00:59:14.360 --> 00:59:16.500
Ran that committee of his down his throat.

00:59:20.940 --> 00:59:21.560
Hello, Joseph.

00:59:22.040 --> 00:59:23.180
