00:59:35.160 --> 00:59:37.940
I didn't lie. I said I didn't make the deal, and I didn't.

00:59:38.080 --> 00:59:39.020
But you agreed to it.

00:59:39.330 --> 00:59:42.720
Tom, you and Ben and the others have known me for more than 20 years,

00:59:42.720 --> 00:59:44.640
and you know there's nothing to worry about when I'm governor.

00:59:46.840 --> 00:59:50.360
Throw a few scraps to Faulkner, but that's all. Nothing has changed.

00:59:50.620 --> 00:59:51.580
You've changed, Joseph.

00:59:51.800 --> 00:59:52.060
How?

00:59:52.920 --> 00:59:53.860
Well, your clothes, for one.

00:59:54.660 --> 00:59:55.380
What a clue.

00:59:56.790 --> 00:59:59.830
And there are rumors about you and...

01:00:00.060 --> 01:00:03.000
Miss Allen, I know I shouldn't mention them.

01:00:03.810 --> 01:00:06.730
Or the story that you and Martha are estranged.

01:00:08.450 --> 01:00:08.830
Is it true?

01:00:10.100 --> 01:00:10.720
Well, in a way.

01:00:11.680 --> 01:00:13.600
What's my personal trouble got to do with it?

01:00:13.680 --> 01:00:14.980
They're all indications of change.

01:00:16.010 --> 01:00:18.940
Then there's the influence that this Nick Beale seems to have over you.

01:00:19.470 --> 01:00:19.830
Influence?

01:00:19.990 --> 01:00:20.150
Nothing.

01:00:20.350 --> 01:00:22.290
He'll loan me some money and I'll pay it back and that's all.

01:00:22.450 --> 01:00:22.910
I wonder.

01:00:23.690 --> 01:00:24.710
Have you signed anything with him?

01:00:25.290 --> 01:00:26.350
Any sort of contract?

01:00:26.470 --> 01:00:27.150
Of course not.

01:00:28.130 --> 01:00:29.050
What are you driving at?

01:00:29.570 --> 01:00:29.970
I don't know.

01:00:30.000 --> 01:00:36.150
exactly. There's something strange about him, something eerie. Supposed to impress

01:00:36.150 --> 01:00:40.370
people. How did he get out of your house the night you were there? Why was he

01:00:40.370 --> 01:00:47.470
afraid to read the Bible? Are you serious? I know I can't be, but I am. And there's

01:00:47.470 --> 01:00:51.880
another thing. Somewhere I've seen a portrait of it, a medieval drawing or

01:00:51.880 --> 01:00:59.580
woodcut. I'm trying to remember where. Drawing as what? Lucifer. We're in the

01:00:59.580 --> 01:00:59.980
20th.

01:01:00.000 --> 01:01:04.780
century tom nobody's believed in such things since the salem witch burnings besides aren't

01:01:04.780 --> 01:01:08.860
there a few items missing where's the tail and the horns where's the smell of sulfur and brimstone

