one slightly used soul deb oh no it's the 20th century too joseph sorry about martha and if

01:01:27.590 --> 01:01:29.980
people are talking about us well i'm sorry

01:01:30.840 --> 01:01:34.180
Oh, I'm not. You're the one thing I'm not sorry about.

01:01:35.110 --> 01:01:36.830
But Ben and the others, that hurts.

01:01:37.260 --> 01:01:38.120
I know, Joseph.

01:01:38.580 --> 01:01:40.000
The trouble is I can't give up.

01:01:40.930 --> 01:01:43.010
I must justify the position I've taken.

01:01:44.400 --> 01:01:45.940
I suppose there are other reasons, too.

01:01:46.850 --> 01:01:49.810
Like the idea of being governor, the flattery of having people know you,

01:01:50.540 --> 01:01:51.940
the authority and the power.

01:01:53.540 --> 01:01:56.130
Sound egotistical, don't I? Selfish, too.

01:01:56.330 --> 01:01:58.920
No, because I know you'll do the best job you can.

01:01:59.400 --> 01:01:59.800
I wonder.

01:02:00.570 --> 01:02:01.250
There's Faulkner.

01:02:01.580 --> 01:02:02.060
He's nothing.

01:02:02.710 --> 01:02:03.450
And Nick Beale.

01:02:04.840 --> 01:02:05.700
Yes, there is Nick.

01:02:07.390 --> 01:02:08.470
How do you feel about him?

01:02:09.910 --> 01:02:11.110
Oh, I don't know, Joseph.

01:02:11.330 --> 01:02:13.290
He gives me the creeps.

01:02:14.980 --> 01:02:17.850
Someone else said that, in other words.

01:02:20.900 --> 01:02:22.080
Joseph, I wish I...

01:02:24.570 --> 01:02:25.490
