Will I see you tomorrow?

01:02:38.190 --> 01:02:38.790
Of course.

01:02:39.810 --> 01:02:40.570
And don't you worry.

01:02:42.260 --> 01:02:44.480
You don't let other people make your decisions.

01:02:44.600 --> 01:02:45.420
You make them yourself.

01:02:47.290 --> 01:02:48.050
Promise me.

01:02:49.900 --> 01:02:50.300
I promise.

01:03:11.480 --> 01:03:23.340
soft. Where did you come from? Chimney. Yeah. Oh, he's in trouble. I bet he is. What's he

