Why don't we forget him?

01:03:34.510 --> 01:03:35.590
Why don't we go off together?

01:03:36.480 --> 01:03:37.320
Just you and me.

01:03:38.480 --> 01:03:39.660
Let him make his own decisions.

01:03:42.880 --> 01:03:44.260
You and I could have a lot of fun together.

01:03:45.100 --> 01:03:45.880
Don't touch me.

01:03:46.980 --> 01:03:48.120
