01:04:06.810 --> 01:04:08.210
I'm taking care of him myself tonight.

01:04:24.630 --> 01:04:24.910
Joseph.

01:04:25.400 --> 01:04:25.720
Uh-huh.

01:04:26.250 --> 01:04:28.250
The inauguration Thursday, I won't be there.

01:04:28.450 --> 01:04:28.850
Why not?

01:04:29.170 --> 01:04:29.830
I think you know.

01:04:30.350 --> 01:04:31.190
Oh, but Martha...

01:04:31.190 --> 01:04:32.870
There needn't be any talk. You can say I'm ill.

01:04:32.950 --> 01:04:34.370
I don't want to say anything. I want you there.

01:04:34.470 --> 01:04:37.070
No, you don't. We're strangers, almost enemies.

01:04:37.860 --> 01:04:39.960
For the last two months, you haven't even known I was alive.

01:04:40.600 --> 01:04:42.350
I guess that's so. I'm sorry.

01:04:42.570 --> 01:04:43.150
So am I.

01:04:44.180 --> 01:04:47.630
