01:05:40.660 --> 01:05:41.960
No, I'd be pleased.

01:05:42.150 --> 01:05:44.590
And if that isn't enough, then I've got the Bond's mother left me.

01:05:47.030 --> 01:05:48.090
I don't deserve you.

01:05:49.540 --> 01:05:52.020
Promise me one thing. Don't see him again.

01:05:52.440 --> 01:05:53.940
Well, I don't know that I can exactly...

01:05:53.940 --> 01:05:56.480
This is the first really important thing I've ever asked of you.

01:05:59.490 --> 01:05:59.910
All right.

01:06:01.530 --> 01:06:01.970
I promise.

