01:14:43.756 --> 01:14:45.916
Park here, Governor, until the ceremony starts.

01:14:49.804 --> 01:14:51.224
I think you ought to look at these.

01:14:51.916 --> 01:14:54.716
I'd interest you to see how far you've come in the past eight months.

01:14:57.676 --> 01:14:59.156
Forster inaugural today.

01:15:02.172 --> 01:15:03.432
Foster elected governor.

01:15:06.012 --> 01:15:08.272
This one goes back to the time when you were district attorney.

01:15:09.372 --> 01:15:12.112
Foster promises clean city with Hanson conviction.

01:15:13.980 --> 01:15:15.300
