Ladies and gentlemen,

01:16:08.124 --> 01:16:12.004
A few weeks ago, the independent party whose candidate for governor I was,

01:16:13.596 --> 01:16:14.476
issued a statement.

01:16:15.356 --> 01:16:19.036
