01:16:42.860 --> 01:16:45.020
Alliances, which I realize now,

01:16:45.644 --> 01:16:47.884
will prevent me from serving my state properly.

01:16:48.492 --> 01:16:50.212
Needless to say, I am ashamed of myself.

01:16:50.988 --> 01:16:54.068
So ashamed that I am taking the only action possible.

01:16:54.988 --> 01:16:56.188
I resigned the governorship.

01:16:57.740 --> 01:16:59.040
In favor of a novice man.

01:17:00.668 --> 01:17:01.748
