01:17:30.000 --> 01:17:30.680
Impressive speech.

01:17:30.940 --> 01:17:32.110
Fine gesture.

01:17:33.230 --> 01:17:34.350
Virtue triumphant.

01:17:34.660 --> 01:17:35.180
Prize defined.

01:17:35.340 --> 01:17:36.040
You take it so well.

01:17:36.180 --> 01:17:37.080
Why shouldn't I?

01:17:38.860 --> 01:17:40.200
Plans didn't quite work out.

01:17:40.560 --> 01:17:41.380
Just the opposite.

01:17:41.620 --> 01:17:43.740
They worked out exactly as scheduled.

01:17:45.000 --> 01:17:45.680
you lost a governor.

01:17:45.820 --> 01:17:47.360
A dime a dozen.

01:17:47.540 --> 01:17:49.780
But you won't get Norton.

01:17:50.220 --> 01:17:51.760
No, I won't get Norton

01:17:51.760 --> 01:17:53.730
or the state seal either.

01:17:54.850 --> 01:17:55.830
We'll talk about that later.

01:17:56.070 --> 01:17:56.830
Yes, we will.

01:17:56.990 --> 01:17:57.370
Soon.

