01:21:19.710 --> 01:21:21.990
Don't you realize, Joseph, you've already won.

01:21:22.840 --> 01:21:27.220
Forget Beale. Go to Martha, who remembers you as you were, as you still are.

01:21:28.420 --> 01:21:29.160
She still loves you.

01:21:30.220 --> 01:21:31.800
The two of you can make a fresh start together.

01:21:34.110 --> 01:21:34.870
