01:23:43.080 --> 01:23:45.080
I've pinned his shoulders to the mat.

01:23:45.540 --> 01:23:48.390
Yes, I've pinned his shoulders to the mat.

01:23:49.010 --> 01:23:51.130
I wonder if he knows it's two falls out of three.

01:24:01.370 --> 01:24:03.570
Not quite the time yet. Have a drink.

01:24:03.710 --> 01:24:05.440
A glass for my friend.

01:24:07.810 --> 01:24:12.320
A man's life made a ten dollar.

01:24:12.640 --> 01:24:13.880
I got my orders, mister.

01:24:14.380 --> 01:24:16.400
Everyone takes the detour. Just follow the signs.

01:24:20.150 --> 01:24:21.710
Your job, you'll never miss it.

01:24:22.120 --> 01:24:23.480
We have important plans for you.

01:24:24.070 --> 01:24:25.720
Wonderful work. Travel everywhere.

01:24:28.270 --> 01:24:29.970
Good evening, Mr. Beale. Good evening, Count Gunn.

01:24:32.040 --> 01:24:35.800
Good evening, Mr. Gale. Hello, Foster.

01:24:39.410 --> 01:24:41.010
Yes, you'll be a valuable addition.

01:24:41.620 --> 01:24:44.240
You'll front, inspire confidence, and people will trust you.

01:24:48.080 --> 01:24:48.760
Shall we move along?

01:25:08.540 --> 01:25:10.780
The last time I was here was quite exciting.

01:25:12.140 --> 01:25:13.120
The city was on fire.

01:25:14.210 --> 01:25:15.670
There were quite a lot of recruits that night.

01:25:16.850 --> 01:25:18.430
Quite a transportation problem.

01:25:19.660 --> 01:25:20.020
What was it?

01:25:20.120 --> 01:25:23.840
What are you doing, darling?

01:25:24.380 --> 01:25:25.940
Filling an agreement, Mrs. Forster.

01:25:26.060 --> 01:25:27.060
No, he's coming home.

01:25:27.500 --> 01:25:28.340
I'm afraid you're wrong.

01:25:29.260 --> 01:25:29.980
Word on paper.

01:25:30.000 --> 01:25:31.420
Right, Forster?

01:25:31.770 --> 01:25:32.310
That's right.

01:25:32.550 --> 01:25:32.870
Joseph.

01:25:33.900 --> 01:25:35.780
I doubt if he put his name to anything, Mr. Pugh.

01:25:36.520 --> 01:25:36.740
Huh?

01:25:38.850 --> 01:25:39.390
Take a look.

01:25:42.290 --> 01:25:42.970
Clear signature.

01:25:44.620 --> 01:25:46.060
Find everything else in order, too.

01:25:46.840 --> 01:25:47.240
Should be.

01:25:47.360 --> 01:25:49.500
My company has negotiated quite a number of these.

01:25:50.090 --> 01:25:50.630
Your company?

01:25:51.160 --> 01:25:52.260
Trading company, Reverend.

01:25:52.560 --> 01:25:54.620
With representatives in all parts of the world.

01:25:55.650 --> 01:25:57.590
Now, if you'll just return it, we'll be on our way.

01:25:59.280 --> 01:25:59.980
Seems to be okay.

01:26:00.000 --> 01:26:03.700
All right. Sorry.

