01:26:20.610 --> 01:26:22.830
Jockey'd mean to a sort of morality play, haven't you?

01:26:24.230 --> 01:26:26.350
We've appeared and said at the name of a cathedral.

01:26:27.140 --> 01:26:28.220
But the props are the same.

01:26:29.040 --> 01:26:29.980
It's always been Bill.

01:26:30.000 --> 01:26:50.480
and candle or that worn out book of yours and it always will be i'm ready beale you are no

01:26:50.480 --> 01:26:59.630
saved yourself just in time didn't you there'll be others who won't

01:27:00.250 --> 01:27:02.880
