01:27:05.060 --> 01:27:10.310
In every one there's a seed of destruction, fatal weakness.

01:27:12.890 --> 01:27:14.270
You know that now, Forster.

01:27:15.260 --> 01:27:15.900
You're lucky.

01:27:16.840 --> 01:27:18.620
You're luckier than I was when I fell.

01:27:20.590 --> 01:27:21.970
That was a long time ago.

01:27:35.950 --> 01:27:37.900
He's gone. But where?

01:27:39.140 --> 01:27:43.850
I wouldn't ask. You've won. That's the important thing.

01:27:45.110 --> 01:27:46.960
Forget him. Go home.
